    "turn_text": "But the kind of the, I'll call it the worst of the old bulls who were Republicans, but by and larger Republicans in name only. I used to say they became Republicans after they decided to run. You know, they wake up one day and decide, you know, I'd like to be in Congress. That'd be really cool. I would get to the adulation and I'd get to go to Washington. And then they say to themselves, well, if I want to be a congressman, what part of do I have to be in where I live? And that's when they decided to be a Republican. And that's all they knew",
